     1→// FV-Lang (Free Value Language)
     2→// A functional-first programming language with strong type inference
     3→//
     4→// This library provides the core compiler infrastructure:
     5→// - Lexer: Tokenization
     6→// - Parser: Abstract Syntax Tree construction
     7→// - Type System: Type inference and checking
     8→// - Code Generator: Compilation to IR/Native code
     9→
    10→pub mod lexer;
